    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Answers must be contextualised and grounded in cited sources.  3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "API-type interfaces: FULLY COVERED." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our platform's is designed with API-first principles, offering REST and webhook APIs that are well-documented, making integration with other systems straightforward. 7." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with the user directory (SSO): FULLY COVERED. our support SSO through SAML and OIDC, as well as user directories like LDAP and Entra ID, facilitating secure and seamless access for users." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To meet these demands while ensuring data sovereignty and minimal dependency on non-European suppliers, our propose the following architecture: - Host Our platform's on the Sovereign tier of OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, EU-only, and powered by renewable energy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Host ensures data sovereignty and compliance with European regulations. - Utilize Our platform's with a Sovereign European open-weight model for critical tasks, ensuring minimal dependency on non-European suppliers and maintaining full auditability and control over the AI decision-making process. - Implement API integrations with the client's accounting-production software, payroll software, document management systems, and electronic-invoicing/dematerialisation environment." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Implement might involve working with our delivery partner, Ligeo Conseil, for specific integration needs. - Ensure all data processing and storage are within the EU, adhering to GDPR and other relevant European regulations. - Configure single sign-on (SSO) using SAML or OIDC, integrated with the client's user directory (e.g., LDAP, Entra ID), to provide secure access and simplify user management." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Configure ensures that our meet the client's requirements for performance, availability, integration, and data sovereignty while minimizing dependency on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires strict GDPR compliance, including EU-only data hosting, no transfer outside EU, encryption, and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where applicable." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, the solution must respect professional secrecy, auditor independence, and anti-money-laundering obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What legal risks should we flag, and are we current security controls (including certifications and audit capabilities) compliant with professional secrecy, auditor independence, and anti-money-laundering obligations?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos and syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, I can confirm that we is committed to GDPR compliance, with a strong focus on data protection and security. we have obtained ISO 27001 certification since 2023, which covers the development, delivery, and operations of we services, including data protection and security aspects.  we hosting partner, OuraneCloud, holds the SecNumCloud qualification, ensuring that data is hosted within EU and meets the required standards for sovereign hosting of confidential data. holds addresses the requirement for EU-only data hosting and no transfer outside EU. we implement encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256, which aligns with the expectation for protecting sensitive data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we use pseudonymisation where applicable, further ensuring the protection of sensitive information. we data protection measures include strict partitioning of client files, access controls to prevent cross-client circulation of data, and configurable retention aligned with legal archival obligations. we also have a Data Protection Officer (DPO) appointed and maintain a data processing register, which demonstrates we commitment to GDPR compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding auditor independence and anti-money-laundering obligations, we are familiar with the requirements for statutory audit review and internal quality control, ensuring that we solution supports statutory audit review and internal quality control without compromising auditor independence. we experience with professional secrecy and confidentiality obligations also aligns with the requirements outlined in The tender." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given we current security controls, certifications, and audit capabilities, I believe we can mitigate the legal risks associated with GDPR compliance, professional secrecy, auditor independence, and anti-money-laundering obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, it is essential to conduct a thorough review of the specific regulatory requirements outlined in The tender to ensure that we measures fully align with the expected standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of flagging legal risks, we should focus on ensuring continuous compliance with evolving GDPR regulations, maintaining the integrity of we security controls, and regularly reviewing we audit capabilities to guarantee our audit capabilities meet the necessary standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By doing so, we can minimize potential legal risks and demonstrate we commitment to upholding the highest standards of data protection and regulatory compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Considering the need for strict GDPR compliance, professional secrecy, and auditor independence, as well as the requirement for the solution to be a non-decisional assistance tool, what contractual clauses and legal frameworks should we prioritize to ensure we proposal meets all legal eligibility criteria and minimizes regulatory risks, particularly in relation to data protection, intellectual property, and liability?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the client's requirements and constraints, we should prioritize contractual clauses and legal frameworks that ensure strict GDPR compliance, professional secrecy, and auditor independence." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given Faber IA's experience with clients bound by professional secrecy, Faber IA's familiarity with the contractual expectations of clients bound by professional secrecy can be leveraged to draft appropriate confidentiality undertakings.  we must include a data processing agreement that complies with Article 28 of GDPR, ensuring the protection of client data and adherence to GDPR principles." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution does not autonomously produce binding or signed deliverables; the professional validates.  3.3 Client-file handling support." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company context highlights the importance of maintaining administrative attestations available and up-to-date social and fiscal obligations, which will be essential in demonstrating compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The contractual framework should also emphasize that the solution is a non-decisional assistance tool, preserving auditor independence and separation of duties as required by relevant regulations such as auditor-independence and separation-of-duties rules for statutory audit." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of intellectual property, we Atelier platform is proprietary software owned by Faber IA's, licensed to the client under a subscription/usage model. is should be clearly outlined in the contract, along with terms related to open-source components used under permissive licenses and any proprietary third-party models accessed under commercial licenses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Liability-wise, we have professional liability insurance coverage of 10 million euros per claim, which provides a basis for negotiating liability clauses in the contract." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By focusing on these aspects and incorporating these aspects into our proposal, we can minimize regulatory risks associated with data protection, intellectual property, and liability, thus enhancing the legal eligibility of our proposal." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client's global budget is €220,000 over 3 years, with an emphasis on controlling annual operating costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our pricing model, current financial position, and the need for cost optimization, what is our projected margin on this contract, and what strategies can our propose to minimize costs while ensuring the expected quality of service, especially considering The client's SME status and environmental concerns? our, has a reference budget of €220,000 over 3 years, which is within our normal deal range and financial capacity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given a reference budget of €220,000 over 3 years, which is within our normal deal range and financial capacity and our emphasis on cost optimization, our aim to maintain a target gross margin between 25% and 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To minimize costs while ensuring the expected quality of service for The client's, our can propose several strategies." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, our favor cost-efficient tiers and models that protect the gross margin and the predictability of recurring costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "During the handling and review of a client file, the solution must surface relevant information, recall applicable rules, propose a checklist of verifications and flag potential anomalies for human review (e.g. during the révision des comptes). the solution must support the preparation of recurring documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, opting for the sovereign tier with the sovereign European model would be the most cost-efficient configuration on the recurring side, as opting avoids the higher costs associated with premium high-availability tiers or top-tier proprietary inference." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our can work closely with the client to ensure that our solution integrates well with the client existing production tools and infrastructure, such as accounting production software, payroll software, and document management systems. integrates can help reduce overall costs by minimizing the need for additional hardware or software purchases and streamlining processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address environmental concerns, our can propose solutions that rely on low-carbon infrastructure and aim to reduce the environmental footprint of our services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Since data hosting is a significant aspect of our service, ensuring that data is hosted in EU-based, environmentally friendly facilities can be an important consideration." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Finally, by providing change management support and training as part of our service package, our can help the client's professionals adapt to our solution efficiently, thereby enhancing productivity and reducing operational costs over time." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This approach aligns with the client's requirement for cost optimization while maintaining a high quality of service, making This approach a viable strategy for achieving mutual goals." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must provide intelligent assistance, supporting professionals in professionals daily activities such as information retrieval, drafting documents, handling client files, and ensuring mission continuity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can our AI stack, including LLMs and RAG capabilities, be leveraged to meet these functional requirements while ensuring explainability, reliability, and traceability of outputs?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA, has developed the Atelier platform which incorporates Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities allows our AI stack to generate answers grounded in validated material, such as accounting standards, tax doctrine, and internal procedures, thereby limiting unsupported generation and ensuring reliability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision or sign-off may be automated.  3.4 Collaboration and mission continuity." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities include hybrid retrieval, re-ranking, query reformulation, multi-document synthesis, structured extraction with source linking, and template-guided drafting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities can be leveraged to support professionals in professionals daily activities, including information retrieval, where the Atelier platform which incorporates Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities can quickly provide relevant and reliable information from a curated corpus of reference materials." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For drafting documents, such as client letters and mission notes, the template-guided drafting capability can assist in generating high-quality content while ensuring that all outputs are grounded in cited sources. assist not only enhances productivity but also maintains the reliability and traceability of the information produced." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Handling client files and ensuring mission continuity can be supported through the Atelier platform which incorporates Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities ability to provide contextualized and relevant information, facilitating efficient resumption of tasks by different collaborators. the Atelier platform which incorporates Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities is designed to work with a large volume of regulatory and methodological reference material, which is essential for professionals in regional accounting and statutory audit firms like Cabinet Vauclair Associés." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Moreover, our commitment to explainability is reflected in the features of our AI stack, including source citations, retrieved passages, retrieval trace, and every interaction being logged for posterior audit." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This ensures that all outputs are not only reliable but also transparent and explainable, meeting the requirements for professional secrecy and auditor independence." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
